  "notes": "USAGE:\nUsed as a する verb: {和解|わかい}する (to reconcile, to settle). Sense 1 is used in interpersonal and international relations; sense 2 is a legal term.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {和解|わかい}する: to reconcile, to settle\n- {和解|わかい}が{成立|せいりつ}する: a settlement is reached\n- {和解|わかい}{金|きん}: settlement money\n- {和解|わかい}に{応|おう}じる: to agree to a settlement\n- {和解|わかい}を{求|もと}める: to seek reconciliation",
